{"title":"Career Roadmap · Horticulture Designer","role":"Horticulture Designer","summary":"A Horticulture Designer combines landscape design with plant science to create functional, attractive, climate-responsive and maintainable outdoor environments. The role focuses more heavily on plant selection, planting composition, horticultural planning and landscape performance than a conventional architectural landscape-design role.","facts":{"Current degree":"B.Arch (Bachelor of Architecture)","Course":"Landscape Architecture"},"about":[],"intro":[],"horizons":[],"sections":[{"heading":"Career Overview","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"A Horticulture Designer combines landscape design with plant science to create functional, attractive, climate-responsive and maintainable outdoor environments. The role focuses more heavily on plant selection, planting composition, horticultural planning and landscape performance than a conventional architectural landscape-design role."},{"type":"p","text":"A B.Arch graduate with a Landscape Architecture specialization can enter this field, but should deliberately add horticulture, botany, soil science, irrigation and plant-maintenance knowledge."},{"type":"p","text":"Typical responsibilities include:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Designing planting schemes"},{"text":"Selecting trees, shrubs, groundcovers and ornamental plants"},{"text":"Preparing planting plans"},{"text":"Creating seasonal planting compositions"},{"text":"Studying soil and site conditions"},{"text":"Designing irrigation strategies"},{"text":"Planning urban greenery"},{"text":"Selecting climate-appropriate species"},{"text":"Designing gardens and public landscapes"},{"text":"Coordinating with landscape contractors and nurseries"},{"text":"Preparing planting schedules and specifications"},{"text":"Monitoring plant establishment and maintenance"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Typical career progression"},{"type":"flow","items":["B.Arch","Landscape Architecture","Plant Science + Horticulture","Landscape / Horticulture Intern","Junior Horticulture Designer","Horticulture Designer","Senior Landscape / Horticulture Designer","Landscape Design Lead","Landscape Consultant / Horticulture Specialist"]}]},{"heading":"Career Horizon","kind":"horizons","blocks":[{"type":"table","header":["Stage","Primary Focus"],"rows":[[{"text":"Year 1"},{"text":"Architecture + environmental fundamentals"}],[{"text":"Year 2"},{"text":"Landscape design + site analysis"}],[{"text":"Year 3"},{"text":"Planting design + horticulture"}],[{"text":"Year 4"},{"text":"Professional landscape projects + internship"}],[{"text":"0–2 years"},{"text":"Junior Landscape / Horticulture Designer"}],[{"text":"2–5 years"},{"text":"Horticulture Designer / Landscape Designer"}],[{"text":"5–8 years"},{"text":"Senior Landscape Designer / Horticulture Specialist"}],[{"text":"8+ years"},{"text":"Landscape Consultant / Design Lead"}]]}]},{"heading":"Year-Wise Roadmap","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"Year 1 — Architecture & Environmental Foundations"},{"type":"p","text":"Build strong fundamentals in:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Architectural design"},{"text":"Site planning"},{"text":"Basic construction"},{"text":"Environmental studies"},{"text":"Climate"},{"text":"Materials"},{"text":"Drawing and visualization"},{"text":"Basic landscape awareness"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Start learning plant fundamentals"},{"type":"p","text":"Understand:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Plant morphology"},{"text":"Roots, stems and leaves"},{"text":"Growth patterns"},{"text":"Evergreen vs deciduous plants"},{"text":"Annuals vs perennials"},{"text":"Native vs exotic species"},{"text":"Sun/shade requirements"},{"text":"Water requirements"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Software"},{"type":"p","text":"Begin with:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"AutoCAD"},{"text":"SketchUp"},{"text":"Photoshop"},{"text":"Illustrator"},{"text":"Excel"}]}]},{"heading":"Year 2 — Landscape Architecture Fundamentals","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Develop the ability to design outdoor spaces."},{"type":"h","text":"Learn"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Site planning"},{"text":"Grading"},{"text":"Hardscape"},{"text":"Softscape"},{"text":"Circulation"},{"text":"Outdoor spaces"},{"text":"Garden design"},{"text":"Planting composition"},{"text":"Landscape ecology"},{"text":"Microclimate"},{"text":"Water-sensitive landscape design"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Important distinction"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Hardscape"},{"text":"├── Paths"},{"text":"├── Paving"},{"text":"├── Walls"},{"text":"├── Decks"},{"text":"├── Pergolas"},{"text":"└── Structures"},{"text":"Softscape"},{"text":"├── Trees"},{"text":"├── Shrubs"},{"text":"├── Groundcovers"},{"text":"├── Grasses"},{"text":"├── Climbers"},{"text":"└── Seasonal plants"},{"text":"A horticulture designer must become particularly strong in the softscape side."}]}]},{"heading":"Year 3 — Horticulture Specialization","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"This should be the major specialization year."},{"type":"h","text":"Learn plant science"},{"type":"h","text":"Plant identification"},{"type":"p","text":"Build knowledge of:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Botanical names"},{"text":"Common names"},{"text":"Plant families"},{"text":"Growth habit"},{"text":"Mature size"},{"text":"Flowering periods"},{"text":"Foliage characteristics"},{"text":"Root behaviour"},{"text":"Maintenance requirements"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Site and soil science"},{"type":"p","text":"Understand:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Soil texture"},{"text":"Soil structure"},{"text":"Soil pH"},{"text":"Soil fertility"},{"text":"Drainage"},{"text":"Soil amendments"},{"text":"Organic matter"},{"text":"Compaction"},{"text":"Salinity"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Irrigation"},{"type":"p","text":"Learn:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Drip irrigation"},{"text":"Sprinklers"},{"text":"Micro-irrigation"},{"text":"Irrigation zoning"},{"text":"Water requirements"},{"text":"Rainwater harvesting"},{"text":"Smart irrigation"}]}]},{"heading":"Year 4 — Professional Horticulture Design","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Work on complete landscape projects."},{"type":"h","text":"Learn"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Planting plans"},{"text":"Plant schedules"},{"text":"Plant specifications"},{"text":"Nursery coordination"},{"text":"Quantity estimation"},{"text":"Landscape BOQs"},{"text":"Maintenance schedules"},{"text":"Irrigation layouts"},{"text":"Landscape detailing"},{"text":"Site execution"},{"text":"Plant establishment"},{"text":"Landscape management"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Professional workflow"},{"type":"flow","items":["Site Survey","Climate + Soil Analysis","Site Constraints","Design Concept","Plant Palette","Planting Composition","Irrigation Strategy","Planting Plan","BOQ + Specifications","Site Implementation","Maintenance + Monitoring"]}]},{"heading":"Core Skill Matrix","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"table","header":["Skill","Target Level"],"rows":[[{"text":"Landscape Design"},{"text":"Advanced"}],[{"text":"Plant Identification"},{"text":"Advanced"}],[{"text":"Horticulture"},{"text":"Advanced"}],[{"text":"Planting Design"},{"text":"Advanced"}],[{"text":"Site Analysis"},{"text":"Advanced"}],[{"text":"Soil Science"},{"text":"Intermediate–Advanced"}],[{"text":"Irrigation"},{"text":"Intermediate–Advanced"}],[{"text":"Garden Design"},{"text":"Advanced"}],[{"text":"Landscape Ecology"},{"text":"Intermediate"}],[{"text":"Urban Greening"},{"text":"Intermediate–Advanced"}],[{"text":"AutoCAD"},{"text":"Advanced"}],[{"text":"SketchUp"},{"text":"Advanced"}],[{"text":"Photoshop"},{"text":"Intermediate–Advanced"}],[{"text":"Illustrator"},{"text":"Intermediate"}],[{"text":"GIS"},{"text":"Intermediate"}],[{"text":"Revit"},{"text":"Intermediate"}],[{"text":"Quantity Estimation"},{"text":"Intermediate"}],[{"text":"Landscape Documentation"},{"text":"Advanced"}],[{"text":"Plant Maintenance"},{"text":"Advanced"}],[{"text":"Technical Presentation"},{"text":"Advanced"}]]}]},{"heading":"Plant Knowledge Framework","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"A professional horticulture designer should develop a structured plant database."},{"type":"table","header":["Parameter","Example Information"],"rows":[[{"text":"Botanical name"},{"text":"Scientific species name"}],[{"text":"Common name"},{"text":"Local/common name"}],[{"text":"Plant type"},{"text":"Tree/shrub/grass/etc."}],[{"text":"Mature height"},{"text":"Expected size"}],[{"text":"Mature spread"},{"text":"Canopy size"}],[{"text":"Sun requirement"},{"text":"Full sun/partial shade/shade"}],[{"text":"Water requirement"},{"text":"Low/medium/high"}],[{"text":"Soil"},{"text":"Preferred soil conditions"}],[{"text":"Growth rate"},{"text":"Slow/medium/fast"}],[{"text":"Flowering"},{"text":"Season/period"}],[{"text":"Foliage"},{"text":"Evergreen/deciduous"}],[{"text":"Maintenance"},{"text":"Low/medium/high"}],[{"text":"Climate"},{"text":"Suitable zones"}],[{"text":"Uses"},{"text":"Avenue/garden/screening/etc."}],[{"text":"Root behaviour"},{"text":"Surface/deep/aggressive"}],[{"text":"Toxicity"},{"text":"Relevant safety information"}]]},{"type":"p","text":"Building this database is one of the most valuable long-term assets for the career."}]},{"heading":"Major Projects","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"Project 1 — Residential Garden Design"},{"type":"p","text":"Design a complete residential landscape."},{"type":"p","text":"Include:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Site analysis"},{"text":"Garden zoning"},{"text":"Plant palette"},{"text":"Planting plan"},{"text":"Irrigation"},{"text":"Lighting"},{"text":"Maintenance strategy"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Project 2 — Tropical / Climate-Responsive Garden"},{"type":"p","text":"Design a garden based on local climatic conditions."},{"type":"p","text":"Study:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Sun"},{"text":"Rainfall"},{"text":"Wind"},{"text":"Soil"},{"text":"Water availability"},{"text":"Then select plants accordingly."}]},{"type":"h","text":"Project 3 — Urban Streetscape Planting"},{"type":"p","text":"Design an urban avenue with:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Street trees"},{"text":"Shrubs"},{"text":"Groundcovers"},{"text":"Pedestrian areas"},{"text":"Shade"},{"text":"Stormwater management"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Consider:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Root conflicts"},{"text":"Utilities"},{"text":"Visibility"},{"text":"Traffic safety"},{"text":"Maintenance"},{"text":"Irrigation"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Project 4 — Native Plant Garden"},{"type":"p","text":"Develop a landscape using predominantly locally appropriate/native species."},{"type":"p","text":"Analyse:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Native Plants","Climate Adaptation","Lower Establishment Risk","Potentially Lower Water Demand","Biodiversity Support"]},{"type":"p","text":"Avoid claiming that every native plant automatically requires less water; site conditions and species selection still matter."},{"type":"h","text":"Project 5 — Rooftop Garden"},{"type":"p","text":"Design a rooftop landscape considering:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Structural loading"},{"text":"Growing media"},{"text":"Drainage"},{"text":"Waterproofing"},{"text":"Wind"},{"text":"Irrigation"},{"text":"Plant selection"},{"text":"Maintenance access"},{"text":"This project combines architecture and horticulture particularly well."}]},{"type":"h","text":"Project 6 — Public Park Planting Plan"},{"type":"p","text":"Prepare:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Master planting plan"},{"text":"Tree schedule"},{"text":"Shrub schedule"},{"text":"Seasonal planting"},{"text":"Irrigation strategy"},{"text":"Maintenance plan"},{"text":"BOQ"},{"text":"This is excellent portfolio material."}]}]},{"heading":"Internship Roadmap","kind":"internships","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"Year 1–2"},{"type":"p","text":"Look for:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Landscape design studios"},{"text":"Nurseries"},{"text":"Botanical gardens"},{"text":"Garden design companies"},{"text":"Urban greening projects"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Focus on:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Plant identification"},{"text":"Nursery operations"},{"text":"Site observations"},{"text":"Basic landscape drawings"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Year 2–3"},{"type":"p","text":"Target:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Landscape architecture firms"},{"text":"Horticulture consultancies"},{"text":"Landscape contractors"},{"text":"Urban landscape companies"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Learn:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Planting plans"},{"text":"Plant schedules"},{"text":"Site execution"},{"text":"Irrigation"},{"text":"Plant procurement"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Year 3–4"},{"type":"p","text":"Target specialized internships such as:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Horticulture Design Intern"},{"text":"Landscape Design Intern"},{"text":"Planting Design Intern"},{"text":"Landscape Planning Intern"},{"text":"Urban Greening Intern"},{"text":"Landscape Project Intern"},{"text":"Try to get field exposure, not only CAD drafting."}]}]},{"heading":"Entry-Level Job Titles","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"The exact title \"Horticulture Designer\" varies across organizations."},{"type":"p","text":"Search for:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Junior Horticulture Designer"},{"text":"Horticulture Designer"},{"text":"Planting Designer"},{"text":"Landscape Designer"},{"text":"Junior Landscape Designer"},{"text":"Landscape Horticulturist"},{"text":"Horticulture Consultant"},{"text":"Landscape Consultant"},{"text":"Planting Design Assistant"},{"text":"Landscape Project Coordinator"},{"text":"Garden Designer"},{"text":"Urban Greening Designer"},{"text":"Landscape Site Coordinator"}]}]},{"heading":"Employer Skill Matrix","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"table","header":["Employer Type","Valuable Skills"],"rows":[[{"text":"Landscape Architecture Firm"},{"text":"Planting + CAD + design"}],[{"text":"Horticulture Consultancy"},{"text":"Plant science + plant selection"}],[{"text":"Landscape Contractor"},{"text":"Drawings + execution + BOQ"}],[{"text":"Nursery / Garden Company"},{"text":"Plant knowledge + procurement"}],[{"text":"Real Estate Developer"},{"text":"Landscape planning + coordination"}],[{"text":"Hospitality"},{"text":"Garden design + maintenance"}],[{"text":"Urban Development"},{"text":"Streetscape + public landscape"}],[{"text":"Municipal Projects"},{"text":"Planting + GIS + documentation"}],[{"text":"Botanical / Research Institution"},{"text":"Plant science + documentation"}],[{"text":"Sustainability Consultancy"},{"text":"Ecology + green infrastructure"}]]}]},{"heading":"Certifications & Training","kind":"certifications","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Useful areas include:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Horticulture"},{"text":"Plant identification"},{"text":"Landscape design"},{"text":"Irrigation design"},{"text":"Urban forestry"},{"text":"Arboriculture"},{"text":"GIS"},{"text":"Sustainable landscape design"},{"text":"Nursery management"},{"text":"Organic horticulture"}]},{"type":"p","text":"A short-term horticulture course or certificate can be especially valuable for a B.Arch graduate because it fills the plant-science gap in the architecture curriculum."}]},{"heading":"Higher Education Options","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"A B.Arch provides a strong design foundation, but for highly technical horticulture roles, additional education in horticulture or landscape architecture can be useful."},{"type":"h","text":"Relevant PG paths"},{"type":"table","header":["PG Area","Relevance"],"rows":[[{"text":"M.Arch Landscape Architecture"},{"text":"⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐"}],[{"text":"Landscape Architecture"},{"text":"⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐"}],[{"text":"M.Sc. Horticulture"},{"text":"⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐"}],[{"text":"M.Sc. Floriculture & Landscaping"},{"text":"⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐"}],[{"text":"Horticulture"},{"text":"⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐"}],[{"text":"Urban Landscape Design"},{"text":"⭐⭐⭐⭐"}],[{"text":"Environmental Design"},{"text":"⭐⭐⭐⭐"}],[{"text":"Urban Forestry"},{"text":"⭐⭐⭐⭐"}],[{"text":"Landscape Ecology"},{"text":"⭐⭐⭐⭐"}],[{"text":"Environmental Planning"},{"text":"⭐⭐⭐"}]]},{"type":"h","text":"Choosing between them"},{"type":"flow","items":["remain primarily a designer?","Landscape Architecture","Landscape / Horticulture Designer"],"label":"Want to"},{"type":"flow","items":["Want deeper plant science?","M.Sc. Horticulture","Horticulture Specialist / Consultant"]},{"type":"flow","items":["Want ecology + urban systems?","Landscape Ecology / Urban Forestry","Urban Landscape / Ecological Specialist"]},{"type":"p","text":"A PG is not necessarily mandatory to begin as a landscape or planting designer, but deeper horticulture education is valuable if the long-term goal is technical horticulture specialization."}]},{"heading":"Specialization Paths","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"Path A — Planting Design"},{"type":"flow","items":["B.Arch","Landscape Architecture","Plant Identification","Planting Design","Horticulture Designer","Senior Planting Designer"]},{"type":"p","text":"Best for design-oriented candidates."},{"type":"h","text":"Path B — Urban Horticulture"},{"type":"flow","items":["B.Arch","Landscape Design","Urban Forestry","Streetscape + Public Landscapes","Urban Greening Specialist"]},{"type":"p","text":"Focus areas:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Street trees"},{"text":"Public parks"},{"text":"Green corridors"},{"text":"Urban biodiversity"},{"text":"Heat mitigation"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Path C — Sustainable Landscape Design"},{"type":"flow","items":["B.Arch","Landscape Architecture","Water-Efficient Planting","Native / Climate-Appropriate Plants","Rainwater + Stormwater Design","Sustainable Landscape Consultant"]},{"type":"h","text":"Path D — Landscape Construction & Management"},{"type":"flow","items":["B.Arch","Landscape Design","Planting + Irrigation","Site Execution","Landscape Project Coordinator","Landscape Project Manager"]},{"type":"p","text":"This path is particularly useful for candidates who enjoy field work."},{"type":"h","text":"Path E — Horticulture Specialist"},{"type":"flow","items":["B.Arch","Landscape Architecture","M.Sc. Horticulture","Plant Science","Horticulture Specialist","Consultant / Research / Management"]},{"type":"p","text":"This is the stronger route for technically intensive horticulture careers."}]},{"heading":"Emerging Technologies","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"1. GIS-Based Landscape Planning"},{"type":"p","text":"GIS can help analyse:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Vegetation"},{"text":"Land use"},{"text":"Soil"},{"text":"Drainage"},{"text":"Urban heat"},{"text":"Green-space accessibility"}]},{"type":"h","text":"2. Remote Sensing"},{"type":"p","text":"Satellite and drone imagery can support:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Vegetation mapping"},{"text":"Tree-cover analysis"},{"text":"Landscape monitoring"},{"text":"Urban green-space assessment"}]},{"type":"h","text":"3. Smart Irrigation"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Soil Sensors"},{"text":"+"},{"text":"Weather Data"},{"text":"+"}]},{"type":"flow","items":["Plant Water Requirements","Smart Irrigation Controller","Optimized Watering"]},{"type":"h","text":"4. AI-Assisted Plant Selection"},{"type":"p","text":"AI can increasingly support preliminary selection based on:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Climate"},{"text":"Soil"},{"text":"Sun exposure"},{"text":"Water availability"},{"text":"Mature size"},{"text":"Maintenance requirements"},{"text":"However, professional plant selection still requires expert validation."}]},{"type":"h","text":"5. 3D Landscape Visualization"},{"type":"p","text":"Use:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"SketchUp"},{"text":"Rhino"},{"text":"Lumion / Enscape or similar"},{"text":"GIS"},{"text":"3D terrain models"},{"text":"to communicate landscape proposals."}]},{"type":"h","text":"6. Digital Landscape Management"},{"type":"p","text":"Future landscape projects increasingly combine:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Landscape Design"},{"text":"+"},{"text":"GIS"},{"text":"+"},{"text":"IoT Sensors"},{"text":"+"},{"text":"Weather Data"},{"text":"+"}]},{"type":"flow","items":["Irrigation Systems","Smart Landscape Management"]}]},{"heading":"Recommended Final Skill Stack","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"Minimum employability stack"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"B.Arch"},{"text":"+"},{"text":"Landscape Architecture"},{"text":"+"},{"text":"Plant Identification"},{"text":"+"},{"text":"Planting Design"},{"text":"+"},{"text":"Horticulture Fundamentals"},{"text":"+"},{"text":"Soil Fundamentals"},{"text":"+"},{"text":"Irrigation"},{"text":"+"},{"text":"AutoCAD"},{"text":"+"},{"text":"SketchUp"},{"text":"+"},{"text":"Landscape Portfolio"},{"text":"+"},{"text":"Site Internship"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Strong candidate stack"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"B.Arch"},{"text":"+"},{"text":"Landscape Architecture"},{"text":"+"},{"text":"Advanced Horticulture"},{"text":"+"},{"text":"Plant Science"},{"text":"+"},{"text":"Planting Design"},{"text":"+"},{"text":"Soil + Irrigation"},{"text":"+"},{"text":"Urban Forestry"},{"text":"+"},{"text":"AutoCAD"},{"text":"+"},{"text":"SketchUp / Rhino"},{"text":"+"},{"text":"GIS"},{"text":"+"},{"text":"Landscape BOQ"},{"text":"+"},{"text":"Site Execution"},{"text":"+"},{"text":"Plant Database"},{"text":"+"},{"text":"Professional Internship"}]}]},{"heading":"Target Profile by Graduation","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"By graduation, the student should be able to independently develop a planting concept and take it toward implementation:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Site Survey","Climate + Soil Analysis","Site Constraints","Landscape Concept","Plant Palette","Planting Composition","Planting Plan","Irrigation Plan","Plant Schedule","BOQ + Specifications","Site Execution","Maintenance Strategy"]},{"type":"h","text":"Portfolio target"},{"type":"p","text":"Build at least 5 strong projects:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Residential garden"},{"text":"Public park"},{"text":"Urban streetscape"},{"text":"Rooftop garden"},{"text":"Native/sustainable landscape"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Each project should contain:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Site analysis"},{"text":"Concept"},{"text":"Plant palette"},{"text":"Planting plan"},{"text":"Sections/elevations"},{"text":"Irrigation strategy"},{"text":"Plant schedule"},{"text":"3D visualization"},{"text":"Maintenance considerations"}]}]},{"heading":"Best Overall Positioning","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"The strongest positioning is not simply:"},{"type":"h","text":"B.Arch + Landscape Design"},{"type":"p","text":"Instead, build the profile as:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Landscape Designer","Horticulture","Planting Design Specialist"],"sep":"+"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"The key differentiator is the ability to understand both design and living plant systems."},{"text":"Architecture"},{"text":"+"},{"text":"Landscape Design"},{"text":"+"},{"text":"Plant Science"},{"text":"+"},{"text":"Horticulture"},{"text":"+"},{"text":"Irrigation"},{"text":"+"},{"text":"Ecology"},{"text":"+"}]},{"type":"flow","items":["GIS / Digital Tools","Professional Horticulture Designer"]},{"type":"p","text":"This creates a practical pathway toward Horticulture Designer → Senior Landscape/Horticulture Specialist → Landscape Consultant / Design Lead, with additional opportunities in urban greening, sustainable landscapes, landscape contracting, horticultural consultancy and ecological landscape design."}]}]}